#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:2
msgid "Pending removal in Python 3.15"
msgstr "Geplante Entfernung in Python 3.15"

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :c:func:`!PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock`: "
"Use :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:6
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyWeakref_GetObject` and :c:func:`!PyWeakref_GET_OBJECT`: "
"Use :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` instead. The `pythoncapi-compat project "
"<https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/>`__ can be used to "
"get :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` on Python 3.12 and older."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyWeakref_GetObject` und :c:func:`!PyWeakref_GET_OBJECT`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef`. Mit dem `Projekt pythoncapi-compat "
"<https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/>`__ lässt "
"sich :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` auch unter Python 3.12 und älter nutzen."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:10
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedObject`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:12
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedUnicode`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode` instead; "
"Note that some codecs (for example, \"base64\") may return a type other "
"than :class:`str`, such as :class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsDecodedUnicode`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyCodec_Decode`. Beachte, dass manche Codecs (zum "
"Beispiel „base64“) einen anderen Typ als :class:`str` zurückgeben können, "
"etwa :class:`bytes`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:15
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedObject`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedObject`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:17
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedUnicode`: Use :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode` instead; "
"Note that some codecs (for example, \"base64\") may return a type other "
"than :class:`bytes`, such as :class:`str`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyUnicode_AsEncodedUnicode`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyCodec_Encode`. Beachte, dass manche Codecs (zum "
"Beispiel „base64“) einen anderen Typ als :class:`bytes` zurückgeben können, "
"etwa :class:`str`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:20
msgid "Python initialization functions, deprecated in Python 3.13:"
msgstr ""
"Funktionen zur Initialisierung von Python, in Python 3.13 als veraltet "
"markiert:"

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:22
msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPath`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"module_search_paths\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.path`) instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPath`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"module_search_paths\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.path`)."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:25
msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPrefix`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_prefix\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.base_prefix`) instead. "
"Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.prefix`) "
"if :ref:`virtual environments <venv-def>` need to be handled."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPrefix`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.base_prefix`). Verwende :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"prefix\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.prefix`), wenn :ref:`virtuelle Umgebungen <venv-"
"def>` zu berücksichtigen sind."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:30
msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetExecPrefix`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_exec_prefix\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.base_exec_prefix`) instead. "
"Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"exec_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.exec_prefix`) if :ref:`virtual environments <venv-def>` need to "
"be handled."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetExecPrefix`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"base_exec_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.base_exec_prefix`). "
"Verwende :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"exec_prefix\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.exec_prefix`), wenn :ref:`virtuelle Umgebungen <venv-def>` zu "
"berücksichtigen sind."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:36
msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramFullPath`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.executable`) instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramFullPath`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.executable`)."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:39
msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramName`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` (:data:`sys.executable`) instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetProgramName`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"executable\") <PyConfig_Get>` "
"(:data:`sys.executable`)."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:42
msgid ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPythonHome`: Use :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"home\") "
"<PyConfig_Get>` or the :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` environment variable instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!Py_GetPythonHome`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyConfig_Get(\"home\") <PyConfig_Get>` oder die "
"Umgebungsvariable :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`."

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-3.15.rst:46
msgid ""
"The `pythoncapi-compat project <https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-compat/"
">`__ can be used to get :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` on Python 3.13 and older."
msgstr ""
"Mit dem `Projekt pythoncapi-compat <https://github.com/python/pythoncapi-"
"compat/>`__ lässt sich :c:func:`PyConfig_Get` auch unter Python 3.13 und "
"älter nutzen."

